    "titleVi": "Phòng tranh",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "section": "Projects",
    "description": "A small art gallery is selling works from different artists and wants to keep track of the paintings using an SQL database. You need to create a user-friendly system to keep track of the art. Store the artists (ID, name, address, town, county, postcode) and the pieces of art (piece ID, artist ID, title, medium, price) given in the book. The user should be able to add new artists and new pieces of art, search by artist, by medium (e.g. oil, watercolour) and by price range, and when a piece is sold it should be removed from the pieces table and saved to a separate text file of sold art.",
    "descriptionVi": "Một phòng tranh nhỏ muốn quản lý tác phẩm bằng cơ sở dữ liệu SQL. Hãy tạo hệ thống dễ dùng: lưu nghệ sĩ (ID, tên, địa chỉ, thị trấn, hạt, mã bưu chính) và tác phẩm (ID, ID nghệ sĩ, tên, chất liệu, giá) theo dữ liệu trong sách. Người dùng có thể thêm nghệ sĩ và tác phẩm mới, tìm theo nghệ sĩ, theo chất liệu (ví dụ oil, watercolour) và theo khoảng giá; khi một tác phẩm được bán thì xóa khỏi bảng và lưu vào tệp văn bản các tác phẩm đã bán.",
    "expectedOutput": "1) Add an artist\n2) Add a piece of art\n3) Search by artist\n4) Search by medium\n5) Search by price range\n6) Sell a piece\n7) Quit\n('Woman with black Labrador', 'Oil', 220)\n('Bees & thistles', 'Watercolour', 85)\n('Trawler Dungeness beach', 'Oil', 195)\n1) Add an artist\n2) Add a piece of art\n3) Search by artist\n4) Search by medium\n5) Search by price range\n6) Sell a piece\n7) Quit\n(3, 2, 'A stroll to Westminster', 'Ink', 190)\n(13, 4, 'St Tropez port', 'Ink', 45)\n(17, 4, 'The old working mills', 'Ink', 395)\n1) Add an artist\n2) Add a piece of art\n3) Search by artist\n4) Search by medium\n5) Search by price range\n6) Sell a piece\n7) Quit\n(6, 4, 'A seagull', 'Watercolour', 35)\n(9, 4, 'Mr Hamster', 'Watercolour', 35)\n(16, 4, 'A baby barn swallow', 'Watercolour', 35)\n(13, 4, 'St Tropez port', 'Ink', 45)\n1) Add an artist\n2) Add a piece of art\n3) Search by artist\n4) Search by medium\n5) Search by price range\n6) Sell a piece\n7) Quit\nSold: Mr Hamster\n1) Add an artist\n2) Add a piece of art\n3) Search by artist\n4) Search by medium\n5) Search by price range\n6) Sell a piece\n7) Quit\n(6, 4, 'A seagull', 'Watercolour', 35)\n(16, 4, 'A baby barn swallow', 'Watercolour', 35)\n(13, 4, 'St Tropez port', 'Ink', 45)\n1) Add an artist\n2) Add a piece of art\n3) Search by artist\n4) Search by medium\n5) Search by price range\n6) Sell a piece\n7) Quit",
